# Where the vendored files come from. Each `catalog-vN.json` is a byte-for-byte copy of
#   vymalo/another-agentic-system : web/src/features/chat/lib/a2ui/catalog/catalog.json
# at the commit named here (the commit that set that catalog version), with the digest of its
# canonical JSON (`catalog_digest`) that `catalog-vN.lock.json` holds.
# `tools/check-vendored-catalogs.sh` compares each file with the published one (CI, job `docs`);
# `tests/ask_v7.rs` compares each digest with its lock.
#
# `catalog-v9.json` is the exception: from `ui-catalog/v2` the catalog is no longer a file of the web but the body of the
# fenced block tagged `json catalog-9` on the contract page, so its line has a fourth field, the path of that page, and
# the script extracts the block from the page at the commit instead of fetching a file.
#
